

# The request as logic (reason_text/2)

The reasoner's reading of the requirement, said again in controlled English: one Prolog term a line, a fact or a rule Head :- Body, neg(Fact) a denial, a variable a thing the sentence introduced with a or every.

program(mvccs)
tree(tree_1)
simulate(mvccs,tree_1)
b_tree(A):-tree(A)
amount(minimum_degree,2)
hold(A,keys):-b_tree(A)
integer(A):-key(A)
may_be(A,key):-negative_integer(A)
have(A,snapshot):-transaction(A)
line(line_1)
read(mvccs,line_1)
hold(A,command):-line(A)
ignored(A):-line(A),blank(A)
begin_at(A,latest_version):-transaction(A)
begin(A,active_transaction):-repeated_begin(A)
cause(A,error):-repeated_begin(A)
may_stage(A,insertion):-transaction(A),active(A)
may_stage(A,deletion):-transaction(A),active(A)
may_commit(A):-transaction(A),active(A)
may_abort(A):-transaction(A),active(A)
may_read(A,key):-transaction(A),active(A)
may_print(A,view):-transaction(A),active(A)
cause(A,error):-transaction(A),\+active(A)
atomic(A):-commit(A)
apply_to(A,changes,latest_version):-commit(A)
create(A,version):-commit(A)
increment(A,commit_id):-commit(A)
end(A,transaction):-commit(A)
increment(A,commit_id):-commit(A),empty(A)
discard(A,changes):-abort(A)
end(A,transaction):-abort(A)
read_as(A,yes):-key(A),visible(A)
read_as(A,no):-key(A),\+visible(A)
printed(A):-key(A),visible(A)
ascending(A):-printing(A)
neg(print(A,line)):-view(A),empty(A)
get(A,yes):-key(A),committed(A)
get(A,no):-key(A),\+committed(A)
print(A,commit_id):-version_command(A)
word(A):-transaction_name(A)
snapshot(A):-view(A)
hold(A,changes):-view(A)
invisible(A):-commit(A),follow(A,snapshot)
have(A,staged_change):-key(A)
kept(A):-change(A),last(A)
delete(A,invisible_key):-blind_deletion(A)
staged(A):-blind_deletion(A)
win(A):-committer(A),last(A)
insert(A,present_key):-redundant_insertion(A)
committed_key(A):-present_key(A)
ignored(A):-redundant_insertion(A)
delete(A,absent_key):-redundant_deletion(A)
neg(committed_key(A)):-absent_key(A)
ignored(A):-redundant_deletion(A)
active(A):-unfinished_transaction(A)
abandoned(A):-unfinished_transaction(A)
neg(committed(A)):-unfinished_transaction(A)
b_tree(A):-committed_version(A)
recursive(A):-insertion(A)
recursive(A):-deletion(A)
heap_allocated(A):-node(A)
unbounded(A):-key_count(A)
unbounded(A):-transaction_count(A)
print(A,answer):-command(A)
neg(print(mvccs,prompt))
neg(print(mvccs,debug_output))